WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.800
I'm here at Nerdcon Nerdfigheria,

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.280
about to get punished,

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.540
and these people are all voting on the things that I am going to blend.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.620
Hello, people!

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.220
(Cheers)

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.780
Is this a situation that mustard is gonna improve?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.900
Is it pudding?

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:16.340
Baked beans, ohh.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.140
[John:] Do you have somebody filming for you?

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.500
[Hank:] No, I need someone to film for me.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.360
Please film me.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.480
First, we have...

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.620
Pop Tarts!

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.560
[John:] They are strawberry flavored.
[Hank:] Regular.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.920
Is what flavor they are.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.640
Hot dogs!

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.100
Now I think we were all rooting for a vegan blend there,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.720
but it's not gonna happen this time.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.420
Sriracha!

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:42.900
Smells spicy.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.240
Have you never had sriracha?

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.400
'Cause you're gonna want it to have some heat.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.520
Number four is baked beans!

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:53.060
[Maureen:] I'll be back.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:54.860
[Hank:] It's got a little bit of beef in there.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:59.080
Everyone stopped being excited just now.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.460
Pudding!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:08.060
Hank, I'm giving away the rest of your sriracha to this nice person in a sailor hat.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.280
Peanut butter is happening now.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.000
I don't know how to get the peanut butter in there

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:11.860
I got it, I got it.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.200
And our final item on the list...

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:24.660
Mustard made it.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.860
(crowd: peanut butter face!)

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:30.620
That's spoken like people who've never done peanut butter face, frankly.

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:33.920
[Hank:] All right,
[John:] Oh. Oh!

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.220
[Hank:] Come on, get down there.
[John:] Oh, it gets worse every time!

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:41.960
[Audience member:] You need to add some water.
[Hank:] Oh, no, yes, there needs to be something added,

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.340
but it's going to be almond milk.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.520
[Hank:] ‘Cause it’s all I had.
[John:] That’s enough, that’s enough.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.900
Just to be clear, you have to eat all of what is in there.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:51.720
That's not happening.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:54.440
Hopefully this will work.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.780
I just saw the Pop Tart go down in a blaze of glory.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.980
I am deeply regretting some decisions I've made in my past.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.920
It looks like meat slurry.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.100
It looks really, really bad.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.700
[Maureen:] Is that the blender, that I just heard?

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:12.820
Yeah, that was the blender.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.940
[Hank:] So you just stay back there, Maureen.
[Maureen:] I'm staying back here.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:17.900
You're in the right place. Hank, can I smell it before you eat it?

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:21.780
Oh, no!

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:26.200
That was very bad.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:29.360
I- I wish there was a way that we had smell-evision in here,

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:32.700
and we could just pump the whole auditorium full of what I just smelled.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.760
[Maureen:] You guys, this was not in my contract.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:39.760
Can I get one more sniff before you take a huge gulp?

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:47.460
I mean, that is very, very bad.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:54.140
Chug, Chug, Chug, Chug, oh, oh!

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.400
I have a little more left.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:07.480
When a Vlogbrother messes up, a Vlogbrother must be punished- it's very spicy!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.580
It took a while for that to hit,

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.180
'cause the peanut butter was masking it.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.660
Maureen, it's over.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:32.600
Okay, Maureen. I put it away, Rodney has taken it away.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.660
Except for this cup part, which you-

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:38.740
I'm not even being funny, legitimately queasy.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:42.400
[Hank:] So I guess this is- Can I just?
[John:] Just chug.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.780
Do what you need to do, Hank.

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:49.840
[Voice-over:] John, I survived. And it was, I think, worth it.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.820
I loved last weekend so much. Thank you to everybody who came out.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:55.000
And thank you also to you, John.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:56.380
I'll see you on Tuesday.

